{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"948b300d-1ff5-4c91-ac6a-027555b4ba32","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented fixes for Intervals.icu OAuth integration:\n\n- Updated scopes to avoid duplicate entries.\n- Added POST‑only init endpoint returning `authorize_url` as JSON.\n- Made GET init endpoint return 405 (Method Not Allowed).\n- Adjusted server routing to use the new POST init.\n- Updated token storage handling for missing `refresh_token`.\n- Modified frontend to intercept the Connect link, issue a POST request, receive `authorize_url`, and redirect.\n- Documented the issues, applied notes from colleague, and provided verification steps in **ANSWER.md**.  \n\nYou can review the detailed explanation in `ANSWER.md` in the artifact directory.\n","duration_seconds":363.198634,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":53998,"output_tokens":33673,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":949632,"total_tokens":87671}}}
